      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We report a case of a runaway cardiac pacemaker in a hemodynamically unstable patient requiring surgical intervention for correction of the malfunction. The technique for gaining rapid access to the permanent pacemaker and disarming it, and for the utilization of a portable pacemaker generator to establish a normal heart rate is presented."},
